response:
UAC-0050 launched a mass phishing campaign distributing password-protected RAR archives containing RemcosRAT and MeduzaStealer, utilizing an AutoIt injector. The campaign targeted entities in Ukraine and Poland using compromised Ukrainian government and commercial email accounts, with RemcosRAT command-and-control servers hosted on the infrastructure of Malaysian hosting provider Shinjiru.

